n) accepts the findings\n  as a JSON array validated against the same entry schema, so a tool need not embed them in\n  markdown. The body's fenced block and `--findings` together are refused as ambiguous.\n- `website/docs/reference/cli.md` documents JSON as the machine-written form of the block and the\n  `--findings` input.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\n- The reviewer charters in `agentplugins` emitting JSON; that repository owns them.\n- Retro-fitting existing immutable `review-result` records.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `crates/plan/aep-backend-markdown/src/findings.rs` — cited (error type and parse)\n- `crates/edge/aep-cli/src/planning.rs` — cited (the `new review-result --from` path)\n- `crates/edge/aep-cli/tests/planning_cli.rs` — cited (existing findings cases)\n- `website/docs/reference/cli.md` — cited (documents the block today)\n- Confidence: medium — paths read by the coordinator with `rg`; no scoper agent ran.\n","document":{"events":[{"args":{"command":"move-status","decided_on":"{\"recorded\":{\"test_result\":1,\"review_outcome\":1}}","target":"ent-28b7fc521b8e03b11f3c40cdb92e6524","to":"implemented"},"changed":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790371020835,"id":"ent-28b7fc521b8e03b11f3c40cdb92e6524","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/review-findings-accept-prose-and-json","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":8,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":1790378553757}},"status":"implemented"},"entity":"aep.entity","from_state":"active","id":"ent-28b7fc521b8e03b11f3c40cdb92e6524","payload":{"actor":"human:timo","at":1790378553757,"causation":"cmd-child-d1f9daa9996e4684a1f4366a1f045ace6b525490c9a5d3fbc9b367caabe64e37","correlation":"protocol-artifact-move","event_id":"aep.entity:ent-28b7fc521b8e03b11f3c40cdb92e6524@8#0~7e68962e72104699","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-25T23:22:33Z"},"revision":8,"to_state":"implemented","type":"aep.status.move/v1","version":1}],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"cre